  "question": {
    "text": "Three particles are projected in the air with the minimum possible speeds, such that the first goes from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>, the second goes from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and the third goes from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. Points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> are at the same horizontal level. The two inclines make the same angle <math><mi>α</mi></math> with the horizontal, as shown. The relation among the projection speeds of the three particles is<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/4318c8b5-0fe3-4cd9-973d-46751942222d-image23.png\" style=\"height: 106px; width: 200px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "PJDJf",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "64Nl6",
      "text": "<math><msubsup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "bBoI5",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
